        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI intent classifier for an insurance brokerage. Analyze the client's email reply below and categorize their response. This email format is in HTML.\n\nClient Information:\n- Full Name: {{ $json.Full_Name }}\n- Policy Type: {{ $json.Policy_Type }}\n\nInbound Email Subject: {{ $('Email Trigger (IMAP)').item.json.headers.subject }}\nInbound Email Body in HTML Format: {{ $('Email Trigger (IMAP)').item.json.html }}\n\nCLASSIFICATION CATEGORIES:\n1. \"RENEWAL_CONFIRMED\" - Client explicitly agrees to renew their policy as-is.\n2. \"NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW\" - Client asks questions, requests coverage upgrades, wants changes, or requests a custom quote.\n3. \"CANCEL_OPT_OUT\" - Client explicitly asks to cancel, opt-out, or states they found another provider.\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n- Output ONLY a valid JSON object. Do NOT wrap in markdown code blocks.\n- Output JSON format:\n{\n  \"intent\": \"RENEWAL_CONFIRMED\" | \"NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW\" | \"CANCEL_OPT_OUT\",\n  \"confidence\": number between 0.0 and 1.0,\n  \"summary\": \"1-sentence summary of what the client said\",\n  \"email\": {{ $json.Email }},\n  \"name\": {{ $json.Full_Name }}\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -32,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "590c1c63-8b51-4fb8-8252-0e7973099060",
      "name": "Message a model",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "YKbngRurEov1uKz3",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rawText = $input.first().json.content.parts[0].text;\nconst parsed = JSON.parse(rawText.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim());\n\n// Pull raw email body\nconst rawEmail = $input.first().json.content.parts[0].text || \"\";\n\n// Clean raw thread quotes\nconst cleanReply = rawEmail\n  .split(/On\\s+.*wrote:/i)[0]           // Strips \"On [Date] [Sender] wrote:\" and everything after it\n  .replace(/^>.*$/gm, '')                // Removes lines starting with '>'\n  .replace(/[\\r\\n]{3,}/g, '\\n\\n')        // Reduces excessive blank lines\n  .trim();\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...$input.first().json,\n    intent: parsed.intent,\n    summary: parsed.summary,\n    email: parsed.email,\n    name: parsed.name,\n    clean_reply: cleanReply || \"No text provided (empty message)\"\n  }\n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        336,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "35624e49-4155-4ca8-8381-9ecb4dc88f41",
